---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>找不到頁面｜基隆海洋廣場 Keelung Maritime Plaza</title>
    <meta name="description" content="您造訪的頁面不存在或已移動。歡迎回到基隆海洋廣場（Keelung Maritime Plaza）旅遊指南首頁。" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#123047" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://keelungmaritimeplaza.com/404/" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="notfound-main">
      <div class="shell">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> 404</p>
        <h1>這一頁，不在港邊</h1>
        <p class="notfound-lead">您造訪的頁面不存在或已移動。不過港灣一直都在——回到首頁，繼續規劃您的基隆海洋廣場行程。</p>
        <div class="notfound-actions">
          <a class="button button-solid" href="/">回到首頁</a>
          <a class="button button-ghost" href="/#faq">查看常見問題</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
